{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01530","headline":"琴曲歌辞 思归引 · 张祜","name":"琴曲歌辞 思归引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"重重作闺清旦鐍，两耳深声长不彻。\n深宫坐愁百年身，一片玉中生愤血。\n焦桐罢弹丝自绝，漠漠暗魂愁夜月。\n故乡不归谁共穴，石上作蒲蒲九节。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}